WEBVTT

00:00:08.796 --> 00:00:10.715
(cheering, whooping)

00:00:17.889 --> 00:00:18.890
(gasps)

00:00:18.973 --> 00:00:21.893
(both jabbering, squawking)

00:00:24.395 --> 00:00:25.313
(laughs)

00:00:25.396 --> 00:00:26.397
(cheering)

00:00:26.773 --> 00:00:29.150
Whoa! I can't wait to
check this place out.
哇 我等不及去四处看看了

00:00:29.233 --> 00:00:30.068
Yeah.
是啊

00:00:30.151 --> 00:00:31.819
-Excuse me?
-(gasps) Dad!
不好意思

00:00:31.903 --> 00:00:34.822
When you two get off this ship,
I expect you both to...
等你俩下船以后 我希望你们可以

00:00:35.573 --> 00:00:36.407
have fun.
玩得开心

00:00:36.491 --> 00:00:37.492
Huh?

00:00:37.575 --> 00:00:38.868
You're a brave kid, Wiener.
你非常勇敢 小鼹

00:00:38.951 --> 00:00:40.161
Wait, what?
等等 什么

00:00:40.244 --> 00:00:41.329
You heard me.
你听到了

00:00:41.412 --> 00:00:43.498
You two should go out
and-and explore.
我让你们俩出去 好好玩玩

00:00:43.956 --> 00:00:45.458
Go where the day
takes you.
想去哪里就去哪里

00:00:46.667 --> 00:00:48.127
But be back before sunset.
但日落前必须回来

00:00:48.878 --> 00:00:51.255
An hour after sunset?
日落后一个小时呢

00:00:51.339 --> 00:00:52.548
Yeah, not a minute later.
好 但是多一分钟也不行

00:00:52.632 --> 00:00:53.549
Deal.
说定了

00:00:54.133 --> 00:00:55.635
I love you, Dad.
我爱你 爸爸

00:01:01.766 --> 00:01:03.309
Hey, okay if we hang
with you guys?
嘿 我们能跟你们一起玩吗

00:01:03.392 --> 00:01:04.519
Sure.
当然

00:01:04.602 --> 00:01:06.145
I always liked him.
我一直喜欢他

00:01:06.229 --> 00:01:07.688
Louis the hero.
英雄路易斯 勇气花美男

00:01:07.772 --> 00:01:09.649
Brave-a-licious.
英雄路易斯 勇气花美男

00:01:10.441 --> 00:01:11.275
(sighs)

00:01:11.359 --> 00:01:13.027
She's not
my little girl anymore.
她不再是我们的小宝贝了

00:01:13.111 --> 00:01:14.987
And you're both
gonna be just fine.
你们都会过得很快乐的

00:01:15.071 --> 00:01:17.198
(sighs)
I know.
我知道

00:01:17.657 --> 00:01:21.536
You know, Sidney, you've got
yourself a nice family here.
你这个大家庭真不错

00:01:22.453 --> 00:01:24.288
A real family.
真正的家庭

00:01:24.664 --> 00:01:26.874
Yeah, I'm pretty lucky.
是啊 我真是命好

00:01:27.458 --> 00:01:29.168
Here, chew this
kiwi for me.
来 帮我嚼一嚼猕猴桃

00:01:29.252 --> 00:01:31.504
Nuh-uh, never again.
没有必要了

00:01:31.587 --> 00:01:32.713
Ta-da!
你看

00:01:32.797 --> 00:01:33.673
Huh?

00:01:35.716 --> 00:01:37.093
(clanking)

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:38.427
(buzzing)

00:01:38.511 --> 00:01:39.387
Ah!

00:01:41.347 --> 00:01:43.349
-Hey, sailor.
-Whoa.
嘿 帅哥

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:54.819
(grunts weakly)

00:02:01.576 --> 00:02:03.161
(gasps)

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:14.297
