不

00:03:30.456 --> 00:03:31.916
Stop!
住手

00:03:33.918 --> 00:03:36.671
Brother, rise above
this base desire.
兄弟 请脱离低级的趣味吧

00:03:36.754 --> 00:03:38.881
Be more than a rodent.
