00:03:50.726 --> 00:03:52.395
(crowd gasps)

00:03:58.985 --> 00:04:00.528
(laughing hysterically)

00:04:00.611 --> 00:04:02.738
(grunting)

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:07.201
(gasps)

00:04:07.743 --> 00:04:09.036
